224
00:11:14,533 --> 00:11:17,961
503 is El Salvador's international calling code.

225
00:11:17,961 --> 00:11:20,319
Police consider it a gang symbol.

226
00:11:20,319 --> 00:11:23,961
A judge called the evidence many layers of hearsay.

227
00:11:24,411 --> 00:11:27,584
A lawyer for the teens, William Freeman of the

228
00:11:27,584 --> 00:11:30,757
